  "worked_solution": "Taking the complex conjugate of each entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\u2015}{A} & =\\overset{\u2015}{[\\begin{aligned}7-\\text{i} & 6+4\\text{i} \\\\ 7-4\\text{i} & 4+9\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\u2015}{7-\\text{i}} & \\overset{\u2015}{6+4\\text{i}} \\\\ \\overset{\u2015}{7-4\\text{i}} & \\overset{\u2015}{4+9\\text{i}}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}7+\\text{i} & 6-4\\text{i} \\\\ 7+4\\text{i} & 4-9\\text{i}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${b}_{12}-{b}_{21}=(6-4\\text{i})-(7+4\\text{i})=-1-8\\text{i}.$",
